rooms_desc ({"This room is carved out of rock. It is quite cool herebut too much so. There is a rack of weapons on the walland a robot pratice dummy in the corner. There is a picture of Luke Skywalker hanging besides one of Darth Vaderon the far wall. A pallet is on the floor neatly made up.There is a small food unit in the corner and a row of candlesare all around the room. This is a simple area for a simpleyet kind person.",0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,})
